        <mxCell id="notes" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;spacingLeft=10;" value="Architecture Principles&#xa;&#xa;• Kafka = Event Backbone&#xa;• Notification DB = Source of Truth&#xa;• Redis = Cache + WebSocket Pub/Sub&#xa;• WebSocket = Real-time delivery only&#xa;• DB keeps notifications when clients are offline&#xa;• Idempotency prevents duplicate notifications&#xa;• Workers isolate external provider failures&#xa;• Retry / DLQ handles failed delivery&#xa;• tenantId should be included in notification data&#xa;• eventId should be used for deduplication" vertex="1">
